            "namespace": "http://oval.mitre.org/XMLSchema/oval-definitions-5",
            "text": "This setting controls the signing requirements for LDAP clients. This must be set to \"Negotiate signing\" or \"Require signing\", depending on the environment and type of LDAP server in use."
